ll,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-07T09:00:27Z","updated_at":"2025-06-28T16:10:59Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5 (dev5) and 4.4.1 (stable)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev5 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8750H CPU @ 2.20GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen calling `draw_dashed_line` with either of the first two parameters as `Vector2.INF`, the game silently exits with no console errors.\n\nThis is not consistent with `draw_line` which handles `Vector2.INF` with no issues, suggesting to me that this is a bug.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. In a new Godot project, create a 2D scene and add script to it.\n2. Override _draw()\n3. In _draw(), call draw_dashed_line() with either of the first two parameters as Vector2.INF\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\n\nfunc _draw() -> void:\n\t#draw_dashed_line(Vector2.ZERO, Vector2.ZERO, Color.RED) # Fine\n\tdraw_dashed_line(Vector2.INF, Vector2.INF, Color.RED) # PROBLEM: Game exits with no error.\n\t#draw_line(Vector2.INF, Vector2.INF, Color.RED) # Fine\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20637896/test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107253/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107253/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}